[0.023, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b[3;24r\u001b[3;1H\u001b[J\u001b[4;2HTraditionally, it’s\u001b[Cserved with unsweetened whipped cream because the cake is  \u001b[5;2Hquite dense.       \u001b[7;1H\u001b[48;2;33;59;73m                                                                                \u001b[8;1H \u001b[38;2;222;224;225mTwo sentences, please.\u001b[39m                                                         \u001b[9;1H                                                                                \u001b[11;2H\u001b[49mSachertorte was created in 1832 by 16-year-old apprentice Franz Sacher for     \u001b[12;2HPrince Metternich’s\u001b[Cguests. Hotel Sacher and Demel later fought over the       \u001b[13;2H“Original Sachertorte” name, which Hotel Sacher ultimately won. \u001b[1;24r\u001b[1;60H\u001b[?2026l"]
